## 1. Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| **API Framework** | FastAPI (Python) |
| **Database** | MongoDB (via `motor` — async driver) |
| **Async Runtime** | Python `asyncio` |
| **LLM (Primary)** | Google Gemini 2.0 Flash / Gemini 2.5 Flash |
| **LLM (Fallback)** | Groq (OpenAI-compatible API) |
| **LLM HTTP Client** | `httpx` (raw REST calls — no SDK) |
| **Code Embeddings** | CodeBERT (`microsoft/codebert-base`) via HuggingFace |
| **Text Embeddings** | BGE-Large (`BAAI/bge-large-en`) for project matching |
| **General Embeddings** | `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` via FastEmbed (384-dim) |
| **Resume Parsing** | [langextract](file:///e:/beproject/ResumeAI-1/backend/server.py#205-215) library + Gemini 2.5 Flash |
| **Fuzzy Matching** | `rapidfuzz` |
| **GitHub API** | Direct REST via `httpx` (GitHub Trees API, etc.) |
| **Frontend** | React (Create React App + CRACO config) |
| **Orchestration** | Pure Python `asyncio` — **no LangChain/LangGraph** |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The system does NOT use LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, or any agent framework. All orchestration is hand-rolled using Python's `asyncio.gather()`.

