## 7. Full Call Chain Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Client([HTTP Client / Frontend])
    Client -->|POST /api/v1/verify/unified| UVR[unified_verification_routes.py]

    UVR --> UVS[UnifiedVerificationService\nunified_verification.py]

    UVS -->|asyncio.gather| GH[_verify_github]
    UVS -->|asyncio.gather| LI[_verify_linkedin]
    UVS -->|asyncio.gather| WS[_verify_web_search]

    GH --> GHS[github_service.py\nverify_github]
    LI --> LS[linkedinScraper.py]
    WS --> VF[verifier.py\nverify_profile]

    GHS -->|Step 2| GHC[github_client.py\nFetch repos & file trees]
    GHS -->|Step 5| PM[project_matcher.py\nBGE-Large embeddings]
    GHS -->|Step 8| CS[code_similarity.py\nCodeBERT]
    GHS -->|Step 9| RS[readme_similarity.py]
    GHS -->|Step 10| BA[behavioral_analysis.py]
    CS -->|If borderline| LLM[llm_provider.py\nGemini → Groq]
    GHS -->|Step 12| SF[signal_fusion.py\nWeighted score]

    VF --> SW[search.py\nWeb search]

    GHS --> DB[(MongoDB)]
    UVS --> DB

    Client2([HTTP Client / Frontend])
    Client2 -->|POST /api/v1/resumes/upload| RR[resume.py route]
    RR -->|BackgroundTask| PR[parser.py\nGemini 2.5 Flash]
    PR --> DB
```

